WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:00.934
Last week, CNN

00:00:00.934 --> 00:00:02.202
exclusively reported

00:00:02.202 --> 00:00:03.670
that prosecutors had an audio

00:00:03.670 --> 00:00:05.071
recording of Trump

00:00:05.071 --> 00:00:05.505
admitting

00:00:05.505 --> 00:00:07.540
he kept a classified Pentagon document

00:00:07.540 --> 00:00:09.776
about a potential attack on Iran will now

00:00:09.976 --> 00:00:10.944
And this is what is new.

00:00:10.944 --> 00:00:12.879
We are learning exactly what

00:00:12.879 --> 00:00:14.381
former President Trump said

00:00:14.381 --> 00:00:16.883
during that private meeting in 2021.

00:00:16.916 --> 00:00:18.418
Now, according to a transcript

00:00:18.418 --> 00:00:19.819
of that recording, Trump

00:00:19.819 --> 00:00:20.520
acknowledged

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:22.856
he hadn't declassified the document

00:00:23.089 --> 00:00:25.525
and they didn't have the power to do so.

00:00:25.792 --> 00:00:27.394
He told people in the room,

00:00:27.394 --> 00:00:29.162
quote, As president,

00:00:29.162 --> 00:00:30.797
I could have declassified,

00:00:30.797 --> 00:00:33.033
but now I can't.

00:00:33.033 --> 00:00:33.500
You know,

00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:34.401
that goes completely

00:00:34.401 --> 00:00:36.136
against what the former president

00:00:36.136 --> 00:00:39.506
has been saying publicly.

00:00:39.873 --> 00:00:40.440
Do you still have

00:00:40.440 --> 00:00:41.474
any classified documents

00:00:41.474 --> 00:00:42.976
in your possession?

00:00:42.976 --> 00:00:43.843
Are you ready?

00:00:43.843 --> 00:00:46.112
Do you know? No, I don't have anything.

00:00:46.112 --> 00:00:48.181
I have no classified documents.

00:00:48.181 --> 00:00:48.782
And by the way,

00:00:48.782 --> 00:00:51.351
they become automatically declassified

00:00:51.351 --> 00:00:52.485
when I took them.

00:00:52.485 --> 00:00:53.186
If you're the president

00:00:53.186 --> 00:00:54.154
of the United States,

00:00:54.154 --> 00:00:56.222
you can declassify just by saying

00:00:56.222 --> 00:00:57.123
it's declassified.

00:00:57.123 --> 00:00:58.992
Even by thinking about it

00:00:58.992 --> 00:01:00.727
because you're sending it

00:01:00.727 --> 00:01:01.494
to Mar a Lago

00:01:01.494 --> 00:01:03.329
or to wherever you're sending it.

00:01:03.329 --> 00:01:05.432
When you send it, it's declassified.

00:01:05.465 --> 00:01:08.668
We I declassified everything

00:01:10.270 --> 00:01:12.272
CNN's Paul Reed broke this story.

00:01:12.272 --> 00:01:13.740
